WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
Nooo!

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
The cap…

3
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:07.500
MXene oxidises the moment it meets air.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Three weeks of work ride on one cap.

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
One drop of MnO₂ slows the oxidation.

6
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.500
That ink prints the flexible device.

7
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.500
Got it!

8
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.000
I will close the next one myself.

9
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The red swarm is a metaphor · Advanced Composites and Hybrid Materials 2026
